SCOPE

The MIT licence above covers the SOURCE CODE in this repository only:
Sources/, Tests/, scripts/ and tools/.

BUNDLED DIGIMON DATA

Sources/DigiTokenBar/Resources/digidex.json is NOT covered by the MIT licence.
It is derived from digi-api.com (https://digi-api.com), which publishes under
Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported (CC BY-SA 3.0) and draws
mainly on Wikimon (https://wikimon.net).

That file, and any work derived from it, is licensed under CC BY-SA 3.0:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/

Changes made to the source data: filtered to the six main evolution stages;
reduced to the fields this application uses; evolution edges pointing outside
the retained set removed; compacted into a single JSON index. The
transformation is performed by tools/build_index.py.

ARTWORK

Digimon artwork is covered by neither licence and is NOT redistributed with
this software. The CC BY-SA licence applies to digi-api's database, not to
Bandai's images. The application fetches images at runtime and caches them on
the end user's own machine.

